  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BHW Treatment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BHW Treatment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta bidrag syftar till 1. Att ge omedelbar tilldelning f&#xf6;r medicinska behandlingar och apparater 
2. Att ge psykisk h&#xe4;lsost&#xf6;d till skadade patienter och deras v&#xe5;rdare 
3. S&#xe4;rskilda best&#xe4;mmelser f&#xf6;r amputationsproteser och rehabiliteringstj&#xe4;nster
4. Att ge ekonomiskt st&#xf6;d och f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjningsst&#xf6;d till familjer och individer</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is aiming  1.	To provide immediate allocation for medical treatments and devices 
2.	To provide mental health support to injured patients and their attendants 
3.	Special provisions for limp amputations prosthetics and rehabilitation services
4.	To provide financial and livelihood support to families and individuals</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention has four objectives

1. To provide immediate allocation for medical treatments and devices

2. To provide mental health support to injured patients and their attendants

3. Special provisions for limp amputations prosthetics and rehabilitation services

4. To provide financial and livelihood support to families and individuals</narrative>
  </description>
